Body:
It's because of the ruff built-in formatter (https://opencode.ai/docs/formatters).

You can disable it in your config

```json
{
  ...
  "formatter": {
    "ruff": {
      "disabled": true
    }
}
```

@instkffff 

> fixed through delete proxy system environment variables.

Could you please help to explain where is the 'proxy system environment variables' ? I also have this problem, but could not find the proxy config.

> [@dkmnx](https://github.com/dkmnx) is it fixed if you do: opencode.json
> 
> ```
> {
> "lsp": {
>     "rust": {
>       "disabled": true
>     }
>   },
> }
> ```

For me yes this resolves it. Otherwise it becomes an unmanageable amount of memory usage.
